<title>USA: OEC Medical names Pepper chief executive.</title>
<headline>OEC Medical names Pepper chief executive.</headline>
<dateline>SALT LAKE CITY 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>OEC Medical Systems Inc said Joseph Pepper will assume the position of president and chief executive officer effective May 15.</p>
<p>Ruediger Naumann-Etienne, who had held the positions, will continue as chairman of the Board and actively work on strategic growth opportunities.</p>
<p>Pepper joins OEC after 10 years in senior management positions with the Ohmeda Inc unit The BOC Group.</p>
